{
  "bodyHash": "kE5A61di/UQ=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"Serilum 整合包。滿載愛心製作。整合 Serilum 的模組，便於下載！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg\" alt=\"關於此整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>額外整合包</strong>是一種特殊類型的模組，將 Serilum 的多個<strong>額外類型</strong>模組整合為一個。雖然我認為將我的模組歸類在一起相當困難，但我仍嘗試這麼做，以方便大家安裝。它使用名為 JiJ（Jar in Jar）的系統。這基本上意味著包含的模組仍保持獨立，同時允許像安裝整合包一樣一次安裝。所有模組仍擁有各自的設定檔，你也能在遊戲內的模組列表中看到它們全部列出。<br><br>此整合包是模組包開發的輔助工具，但並未取代我個人偏好的模組化系統。不過，你可以透過整合包的設定檔來停用包含的模組。<strong>需要重新啟動遊戲才能讓變更生效。</strong><br><br>由於 JiJ 系統的運作方式，它可以同時兼容正常安裝的模組和整合包中包含的模組。這主要可用於強制使用特定版本，但如果模組意外被安裝兩次，也不會造成問題。雖然可能不構成問題，但當然最好只安裝一次。因此，如果你決定安裝此整合包，可以移除其他包含在內的同類模組。<br><br>我希望這個整合包能對那些偏好大型內容模組的人有所幫助。非常感謝多年來的所有支持！<br><br></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAllLootDrops</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAprilFools</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBiggerSpongeAbsorptionRadius</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBouncierBeds</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCryingGhasts</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCryingPortals</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableDeathBackup</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEasyElevators</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEdibles</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableExtractPoison</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFallThroughSlime</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFasterCrouching</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFixedAnvilRepairCost</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableGrassSeeds</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableHandOverYourItems</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableInfiniteTrading</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMilkAllTheMobs</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNameTagTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePaperBooks</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePassiveEndermen</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePlaceableBlazeRods</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRandomBoneMealFlowers</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRandomSheepColours</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRandomShulkerColours</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableShulkerDropsTwo</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableTNTBreaksBedrock</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableTranscendingTrident</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableVillagerDeathMessages</strong>&nbsp;(預設 = true)</span></div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg\" alt=\"可用整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下 Serilum 模組整合包可供使用：</span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006994\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 客戶端整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#999\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 自訂整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#804d4f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 額外整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#bf8f6f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 生活品質整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006b3f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum RPG 整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#805a46\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 生成整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg\" alt=\"包含的模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-loot-drops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/all-loot-drops.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-loot-drops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">All Loot Drops</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">生物會掉落所有可能的戰利品，掉落數量可設定，支援掠奪附魔。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/april-fools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/april-fools.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/april-fools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">April Fools</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在愚人節這天開啟各種滑稽有趣的可設定功能！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bigger Sponge Absorption Radius</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">每多放置一個相鄰的海綿方塊，吸水半徑就會增加。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bouncier-beds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bouncier-beds.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bouncier-beds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bouncier Beds</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">讓玩家在床上可彈跳得更高（高度可設定），並防止掉落傷害。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crying-ghasts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/crying-ghasts.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crying-ghasts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crying Ghasts</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">當玩家靠近時，地獄幽靈會週期性地掉落眼淚，實現可持續農場。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crying-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/crying-portals.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crying-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crying Portals</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許使用哭泣的黑曜石方塊建造地獄傳送門。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-backup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/death-backup.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-backup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Death Backup</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在玩家死亡前備份其物品欄，可透過指令載入。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-elevators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/easy-elevators.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-elevators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Elevators</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">透過多方塊電梯快速上下移動！高度可設定，使用現有資源。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edibles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/edibles.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edibles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Edibles</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">讓許多原料變得可食用，食用後玩家會獲得短暫的狀態效果。可食用烈焰粉、螢石粉、岩漿球、糖、地獄幽靈之淚、夜魅膜和兔子腳。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extract-poison\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/extract-poison.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extract-poison\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extract Poison</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">用玻璃瓶從洞穴蜘蛛、河豚和蜜蜂身上提取毒液。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fall-through-slime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fall-through-slime.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fall-through-slime\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fall Through Slime</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">黏液塊不再支撐你的重量，靜止時你會慢慢穿過它掉落。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/faster-crouching\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/faster-crouching.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/faster-crouching\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faster Crouching</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">蹲下/潛行時可以衝刺和行走，速度與正常時相同。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fixed-anvil-repair-cost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fixed-anvil-repair-cost.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fixed-anvil-repair-cost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fixed Anvil Repair Cost</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">修復鐵砧，設定預設的經驗等級消耗、材料消耗和修復百分比。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grass-seeds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/grass-seeds.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grass-seeds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grass Seeds</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許玩家使用普通種子將泥土轉變為（高）草。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hand-over-your-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hand-over-your-items.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hand-over-your-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hand Over Your Items</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">新增功能，讓遊戲中的玩家無需丟棄或拋出即可互相給予物品堆疊。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinite-trading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/infinite-trading.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinite-trading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Infinite Trading</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">防止村民交易鎖定，使其隨時可用。盡情交易！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/milk-all-the-mobs.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Milk All The Mobs</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許綿羊、駱馬、豬、驢子、馬和騾子產出一桶牛奶。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/name-tag-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/name-tag-tweaks.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/name-tag-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Name Tag Tweaks</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">新增命名牌合成配方、指令，且被命名的生物死亡時會掉落其命名牌。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paper-books\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/paper-books.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paper-books\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paper Books</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許使用9張紙製作書本。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/passive-endermen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/passive-endermen.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/passive-endermen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Passive Endermen</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">防止終界使者傳送、放置/拾取方塊（破壞地形）以及在被注視時攻擊。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placeable-blaze-rods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/placeable-blaze-rods.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placeable-blaze-rods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Placeable Blaze Rods</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使烈焰桿可作為自定義方塊放置於世界中，類似於終界燭。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-bone-meal-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-bone-meal-flowers.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-bone-meal-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Random Bone Meal Flowers</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">將骨粉生成的花朵隨機化，使所有（模組）種類的花朵都能在任何地方生成。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-sheep-colours\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-sheep-colours.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-sheep-colours\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Random Sheep Colours</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">新生成的綿羊會根據可設定的列表獲得隨機的羊毛顏色。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-shulker-colours\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-shulker-colours.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-shulker-colours\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Random Shulker Colours</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">新生成的界伏蚌會根據可設定的列表獲得隨機的外殼顏色。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulker-drops-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/shulker-drops-two.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulker-drops-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shulker Drops Two</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">讓界伏蚌掉落兩個或更多外殼，並忽略其預設掉落機率。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tnt-breaks-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/tnt-breaks-bedrock.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tnt-breaks-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TNT Breaks Bedrock</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許TNT破壞基岩，輕鬆進入地獄頂層！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transcending-trident\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/transcending-trident.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transcending-trident\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Transcending Trident</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">強化三叉戟。手持水桶可在任何地方使用更強大的波濤附魔。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-death-messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/villager-death-messages.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-death-messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Death Messages</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">每當村民死亡時，會廣播一條資訊性的死亡訊息。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內，您可以自由在任何模組包中使用此組合包。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立模組頁面中一一追蹤留言，因此留言功能已關閉。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝您！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
